romu mu bari luñu koy joxante ci net bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYoyou khettou video ak nataal you khoromou nitt gni daniou len di diokhanté lou bari thi mejaa sosio yi, souko défé gnou gawa nekk meme. Meme moy nataal, video wala mbind mou khoromou mou bari louniou koy diokhanté thi net bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3411,"row":{"en":"It all started when I was hanging out with some friends one night, and we decided to order a pizza.","wo":"Lépp a ngi tàmbali bima genn guudi ma nekk ak samay xarit ba yàgg ñu ni nañu komànde pizza.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLepp a ngui tambali bima guenn goudi ma nekk ak samay kharit ba yagg gnou ni nagnou komandé pizza.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3412,"row":{"en":"When tissue is injured, the body’s immune system sends white blood cells to the area.","wo":"Su der bi gaañoo, system immunitaire bu yaram wi dafay yónnee seluli deret yu weex ca barab ba.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou der bi ganio, system immunitaire bou yaram wi dafay yoné séluli derét you wekh thia barab ba.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3413,"row":{"en":"These were simple organisms, such as bacteria and algae.","wo":"Mbindéef yu ndaw lañu woon, yu melni bakteri ak algue.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbindef you ndaw lagnou wone, you melni bactérie ak algue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3414,"row":{"en":"Some might prefer early morning while others prefer late night.","wo":"Ñenn ñi suba teel gi moo leen gënal, ñeneen ñi guddi gi moo leen gënal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén gni souba teel gui mo léne geunal, gnénéne gni goudi gui mo léne geunalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3415,"row":{"en":"Even sports teams and political parties have started turning to audio branding.","wo":"Ba ci ekipu sport yi, pàrti politik yi tàmbali woon nañu wëlbatiku ci màrku audio yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa